issues.body:
In the Armenian (`hy`) locale, an `invalid_value` issue with a single expected value reads `issue.values[1]` (`packages/zod/src/v4/locales/hy.ts`, line 125), so the message names `undefined`:

```ts
z.config(z.locales.hy());
z.literal("tuna").safeParse("salmon").error.issues[0].message;
// 4.6.7: 'Սխալ մուտքագրում․ սպասվում էր undefined'
// expected: 'Սխալ մուտքագրում․ սպասվում էր "tuna"'
```

Every other locale reads `issue.values[0]` there. A one-line fix with a test (`locales_hy.test.ts`) is ready on https://github.com/bokelley/zod/tree/fix/hy-locale-invalid-value (commit https://github.com/bokelley/zod/commit/d7bc23d). I tried to open it as a PR but the repository didn't allow it from my account. Happy to open it if PRs can be enabled for me, or feel free to take the commit.

