Sorry for the intrusion, I made a fix anyway. It's in my [fork](https://github.com/grishmadev/zod/tree/prototype-key-fix) which I cannot PR because of the lock.
I followed up with your suggestion. and it's valid.
So thank you very much for the nudge!

This is the result in the fork:
```ts
import * as z from "zod";

console.log(z.object({ constructor: z.string().optional() }).safeParse({}));
// { success: true, data: {} }
console.log(z.object({ constructor: z.unknown() }).safeParse({}));
// { success: false, error: [Getter/Setter] }
```
